OL,3,GNEWSASon of ex-Chelsea player died in
OL,4,A40C desert hike
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe son of ex-Chelsea midfielder Eddie
OL,7,FNewton ignored pleas from his wife to
OL,8,Fnot go on what turned out to be a fatal
OL,9,F40C (104F) desert hike, a coroner said.
OL,11,FRescue teams found the body of Cassius
OL,12,FNewton, 34, in the mountainous region
OL,13,Fof Wadi Naqab, United Arab Emirates
OL,14,F(UAE), on 18 July - hours after the
OL,15,Fcouple last spoke, an inquest was told.
OL,17,FHis friend, Aran Martinson, from
OL,18,FBishop's Stortford in Hertfordshire,
OL,19,Falso died in the sweltering heat after
OL,20,Fthey set off at about 07:00 local time
OL,21,F(04:00 BST).
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
