OL,3,GNEWSASon of ex-Chelsea player died in
OL,4,A40C desert hike
OL,5,
OL,6,FArea coroner Michelle Brown ruled their
OL,7,Fdeaths were the result of misadventure
OL,8,Fand said: "This was an intentional trip
OL,9,Fwith unintended consequences."
